WEBVTT

00:02:58.871 --> 00:03:04.288
each step between A and Z is
independent from the others

00:03:04.288 --> 00:03:08.288
and very likely— 
99%.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:13.621
So the probability that A causes B,
that B causes C,

00:03:13.621 --> 00:03:19.079
that C causes D, and so on, 
is each 99%.

00:03:19.496 --> 00:03:25.704
Even so, each additional step adds 
an opportunity to alter the outcome,

00:03:25.704 --> 00:03:31.246
and A is only 78%
likely to lead to Z—